Huh?

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.420
Took you long enough. What are you reading?

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:25.250
Oh, this? It's a-

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.210
Ako, Princess of Darkness has come
to answer your summons!

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.460
Bam!

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.630
Oh, Ako! Morning!

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:33.520
Morning!

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.540
Morning!

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:38.420
Morning, Ako-chan. I've got some pics-

