00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.830
We had a live show at a venue
called Galaxy last week.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:46.130
PoPiPa were there too!

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.210
Oh! Did you perform, Rokka?

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.080
I just work there part-time...

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.580
