00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:55.400
I sort of was, back in my hometown...

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.780
I'd like to form one here, 
but I don't know anyone...

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.130
What, me?

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:05.460
You could pick drums, bass, keyboard,
vocals- anything you want!

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.380
Sorry, I've gotta study 
for my entrance exams...

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:09.540
Hm? For where?

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:10.670
College.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.050
I want to get into a good school.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.040
I've gotta work hard too...

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.040
Someday I'll be on that stage!

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.230
Oh hey, that's my sister.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.040
S-S-S-Sis-Sis...?!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.910
Hanasakigawa Girls' Academy

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:05.990
Can you believe it, Arisa?
 Our own live show!

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:07.630
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:11.370
You may have mentioned that yesterday...
And this morning... And at break time.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.830
I hope the girls get here soon!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.000
I have so many ideas I wanna share!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.080
Ooh, that rolled omelet looks yummy.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.080
Go on.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.220
Which one do you want for it?

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.210
Hmm...

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:25.640
I want a rolled omelet too.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:30.210
Hold on! That Ichigaya special
rolled omelet is reserved for me.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.670
You take reservations?!

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.080
Uh, no...

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.330
Want one?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.750
Thanks, Arisa-chan.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.710
That's good stuff.

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:43.540
O-Tae, it's a trade! Gimme something!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.870
So, what exactly do we have to do
for a self-sponsored show?

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:49.870
Hm?

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.120
They're different from the shows

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.100
we usually do at Circle or the one 
at Galaxy the other day, right?

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:59.340
Yep. Those are booked gigs,
meaning the venue is sponsoring the show.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.790
Self-sponsoring means you have total freedom.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:06.000
You pick the venue, the date,
the guests, the content... everything.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:07.880
Content, huh...

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.330
Oh! I have some ideas!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:10.670
Okay!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.540
I've got a few options,
but this one's definitely my favorite!

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.960
Kasumi
Saaya
Rimi
Cornet

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:16.710
Huh?

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.290
You want us to FLY?

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.210
Arisa
Tae

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.000
Yeah! Right off the stage!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.500
What? Off the stage?

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.250
Ohh!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.750
That's so cool...

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.170
Fly where? Into the crowd?!

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.080
No...

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:29.790
Into the sky!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:33.960
Well, we'd have to do it at a pretty big venue
if that were the case.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.710
Like Budokan?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.040
Ooh! We could invite ALL our friends there!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.080
And get Mortin to guest perform!

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.010
Who?

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.750
Sounds pretty big!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.080
I'll have to practice flicking 
my picks out super far.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.600
Me too!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:52.130
Hey...

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.420
Never mind. I'm done.

00:04:55.130 --> 00:04:56.290
Student council?

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.080
Yeah, I've gotta help organize
some paperwork in the office.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.580
We've got P.E. next, right?
We should go change.

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:05.880
Shall I escort you to the student
council office, Princess Arisa?

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.500
Yeah, yeah, do as you please.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.040
Good luck!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.830
I wanna write some new songs.

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.080
Yeah.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.550
Student Council Office

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.960
Didn't get enough sleep?

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:35.630
We've been so busy prepping 
for our live show... Sorry.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:37.500
Oh, the self-sponsored one?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:42.570
Yeah. Now that we've announced it,
we really have to start putting things together.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.000
Things must be crazy for 
Poppin' Party too, huh.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:49.380
Oh, well... Uh, that is...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:54.920
Um... I thought you guys already
announced your live show.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:58.830
S-sorry! That was just Kasumi
being her usual impulsive self!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.090
Sounds like Toyama-san.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.420
Being excited is good, but...

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:05.540
Yes...?

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:12.710
Well, in our case, we started with a meeting
to discuss our plans in detail.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:16.420
What sort of venue capacity we were looking at,
what kind of show we wanted to put on...

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:19.250
Ironing out our goals was step one.

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.630
Next was location.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:22.000
H-hold on!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.040
We negotiated with the venue staff
and reserved the space,

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.500
then came negotiations with our guest bands,

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:31.580
meetings on minimum ticket sales,
creating the overall schedule,

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:36.250
which includes our rehearsal time
as well as time spent removing our equipment.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:40.750
Next, there's creating the tickets and fliers,
then distribution and sales.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.580
Minimum ticket sales... Time schedule...

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.580
Depending on the ticket price, the minimum sales
for each band can change quite a bit.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.000
Depending on the ticket price, the minimum sales
for each band can change quite a bit.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.000
That's what needs to be done BEFORE the show.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.960
BEFORE the show? There's more?!

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.050
You've also got rehearsals, 
performance check-ups...

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:56.140
Then making the costumes, touch-ups...

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.670
Seriously?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:03.710
Bet it'll be me and Saaya 
doing all of that...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.980
Ugh.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.400
There's no way Kasumi'll 
help with any of that...

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.420
Hikawa-san.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:12.380
Um, we could still fit one more guest band
into our lineup, couldn't we?

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:13.250
Hm?

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.790
Sure, as long as we get permission
from Minato-san, that is...

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.790
Ichigaya-san, would you 
like to perform with us?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.790
Thank you so much!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:27.820
Thank you!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:28.760
Thank you!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.670
I like your spunk!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.790
What do you think, Yukina-san?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.580
I'm super on board!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.040
It's so much more fun to play with friends!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:41.630
Ako, this isn't a game.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:47.460
As for you guys, half-baked performances
have no place at a Roselia show.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.900
Is that clear?

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.880
Got it!

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.500
That settles it then.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.830
I'd like to officially invite Poppin' Party
to perform with us.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:05.960
Do you accept?

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.300
We'll do our best!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.540
Yay!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.830
I'll let O-Tae-chan and Saaya know.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.420
We're gonna need way more practice sessions.

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:20.140
What are your schedules?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:20.960
-Let's set 'em up!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:21.710
-Look, they're so amped up.
-Let's set 'em up!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:22.750
-Look, they're so amped up.
-Arisa, you have student council, right?

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:23.130
-Arisa, you have student council, right?

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.210
-Of course they are...
-Arisa, you have student council, right?

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:24.750
-Of course they are...
-Yeah.

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.880
-Their technical skills aren't exactly the greatest, but...
-And Saaya has to help out at the bakery.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.080
-Their technical skills aren't exactly the greatest, but...
-Scheduling this week might be tough...

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.290
-Scheduling this week might be tough...

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:29.830
-Yeah, maybe.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:30.960
-But...?
-Yeah, maybe.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.000
Don't we need to ask about something?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.040
Well, I'm looking forward to it.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.080
Oh, Lisa-san?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.540
Um, what about ticket sales?

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.250
Oh, don't worry about that.
You guys are good this time.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.630
Tickets are selling pretty well so far,

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:50.210
so we should be able to handle
the venue rental costs on our own.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.670
Student discount, girls 
discount, diva discount...

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:56.790
I used all my magic powers for this.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.000
Diva discount...

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.130
Lisa's negotiation skills are no joke!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:03.670
Our pre-order tickets are a super good deal,

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.170
so if you're thinking of bringing some friends,
I recommend buying a bundle!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.060
A bundle?!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.710
Do you even know what that means?

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.540
You guys...

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.420
How come you're not doing it at Circle?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:13.170
Marina-san!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.040
Do a sponsored show here!

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.130
Come on, time for rehearsal.

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:20.500
We'll give you a discount! 
For being our regulars!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.920
Wait! Why the cold shoulder?

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.580
Roselia Live Guest Performance!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.000
Guys!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.840
Look, look! I made a rehearsal schedule!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.130
