when we're all available, huh.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:43.830
How'd you do that, Saaya-chan?

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.290
You're a telepathista!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:47.380
A telepa...thist?

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.790
I think you're mixing things up.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.330
Let's do our best for the live show!

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.580
Live show?!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.690
Oh no, did they see me?

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:00.250
Oh, it's you, A-chan!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.210
They saw you.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:02.830
What?

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.410
Rokka-chan?

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.710
What's with the screaming?

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.420
You've got the same uniform as A-chan!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.000
We're in the same class.
She said she want to meet y-

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.880
No, I- I just- I didn't say that!

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.630
Thanks!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.170
And thanks again for the show the other day!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.540
Sis, can you let her breathe a little?

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.580
Sorry!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.960
I-it's okay! Thank you!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.830
Hm?

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:33.250
Oh, uh... The, um, live show...

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.790
Is it PoPiPa's?

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:37.380
Nope, it's Roselia's self-sponsored show.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.080
We're performing too!

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.250
I want to go!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.750
I mean, is it okay if I go?

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:48.130
Well, instead of reserving... 
I'll bundle you!

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.380
See you at home, A-chan!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.170
A PoPiPa live show...

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.830
I'm so excited!

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:01.170
Speaking of which, weren't we gonna
hang out the day of the show?

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.210
Huh?

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.300
Wait!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.760
Saturday 5/4
Hang out with Asuka

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.080
5.04 Shibuya dub

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.450
Rimi, that sounded great!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.670
Yeah, we were right on tempo!

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:32.370
Thanks! Maybe my morning practice is working.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.750
I can't believe the show's 
almost here already.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.830
I can't wait to stand up on that stage.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:45.580
Are those snacks?

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:47.850
Yeah, my dad told me to bring some.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.630
It's here.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:55.750
Yay!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:01.250
Our show's today! We're gonna do our best!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.670
Our show's today!

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:02.790
Our show's today!
We're gonna do our best!

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.250
Good morning!

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.130
Whaaat?!

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.750
S-Sayo-senpai!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.250
Risa-san, hang in there!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.420
The crime took place behind closed doors,
in the waiting room...

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:19.500
Crime?!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.670
Should we call an ambulance?
The police? A detective?!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.880
Don't be stupid-help me get them up!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.050
Hey, are you okay?!

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:30.580
The dark dragon living in my right eye is...

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.290
is so cool...

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.750
Man, I think we actually passed out.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:42.330
Did you guys not sleep yesterday either?

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:46.570
So much of our time got taken over
by the show's preparation...

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.960
We said that we'd do all of the

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:52.760
venue set-up today so that we 
could keep the rental costs down.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.580
It was kind of unavoidable...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.040
That was really embarrassing.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:58.750
Hello?

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.750
Oh, hi. Thanks for doing this today.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:03.790
The entrance?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.330
Be right there. I'll be right back, guys.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.640
Once the guests are all here, 
let's start the rehearsal.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.670
I'll go let the staff know.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.380
Udagawa-san, did you get 
everything from the caterers?

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.750
Of course!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.460
Maybe we should offer to help.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.580
I can help!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:27.670
We can handle this just fine on our own.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:29.830
You focus on getting ready to perform.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.790
O-okay!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.330
What are you doing?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.540
Just curious to see if it's real...

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.380
The venue's this way. Let's go.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.000
Wait for me!

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.580
Thank you!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.420
Last up is Roselia, please!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.260
Oh! Would it be okay if I watch you guys?

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.850
Sure! Watch and learn!

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:39.580
Hm? Where's Yukina-senpai?

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:48.130
Can you turn up the reverb please?

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.920
Got it. How's this?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.700
Thank you.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.660
Yukina-senpai!

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.460
Your rehearsal's starting...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.670
We've already done our rehearsal.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.960
This is just the final stage check.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.130
Stage check?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:11.460
Sometimes the equipment and set-up
can block the view from parts of the crowd.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:15.790
Can you turn the lighting down a bit, please?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.210
Got it.

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.730
Lisa, can you see your hands?

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:27.670
You adjust things right 
up to the threshhold, huh.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:32.920
Of course. We want to deliver our music
to the audience in the best way we can.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.750
The doors will be opening soon.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.080
Let's get started.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.250
You okay?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.830
I never thought I'd drown 
in the middle of the city...

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:58.420
Let's go!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.190
Tickets, please.

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.750
Um...

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:06.170
We're here with Poppin' Party!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.000
A bundle for Rokka Asahi.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.330
I don't see you.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.880
Wh-what?!

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.950
What about Asuka Toyama?

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.870
Oh, okay. Two tickets, right?

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.330
Thank goodness...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.540
Sis...

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.460
Thank you! Thank you!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.830
Oh man, I'm getting nervous.

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.830
Arisa, give me your hand.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.220
Note: In Japanese folklore, it's believed that drawing
the kanji for "person" on your hand a few times,

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.220
One person.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.920
then "eating" those people 
will quell nervousness.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.920
I can help.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:36.930
One person, two people.

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.380
Me too!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:41.630
One person.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.580
Me too! One person.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.790
Jeez, I don't need that many!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.920
Poppin' Party, you're up!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.460
Okay!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.790
We're Poppin' Party!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.710
Thank you!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.550
Po-Po-PoPiPa!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:19.100
Yay!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.380
They were so cute!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.460
Love their music!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.750
That was so much fun!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.880
Yeah! The crowd were so into it!

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.710
I think that might've been our best ever!

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:37.710
I dunno about THAT...

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:43.330
Yukina-senpai! We...

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.580
Thanks. You did well.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.670
Black Shout

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.920
First off, let's introduce the band.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.940
On guitar, Sayo Hikawa!

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.670
On bass, Lisa Imai!

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:21.880
Hi guys.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.080
On drums, Ako Udagawa!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.630
On keyboard, Rinko Shirokane!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:34.760
And our vocalist, Yukina Minato!

00:18:37.580 --> 00:18:39.470
Listen to our... "BLACK SHOUT."

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.170
Yukina! We love you!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.080
That was so amazing!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.080
Roselia are just too good!

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.600
I can't get over their style!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.380
You guys were awesome!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:44.960
Thanks! You guys really
warmed up the crowd for us!

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:51.080
That. Was. Amazing!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.850
Seriously.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.040
The crowd still looked so 
pumped, even afterwards.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.790
Everyone waved their lights in sync...

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:59.330
It was so pretty.

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:02.830
They were all so into it...

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:11.290
Is this the standard for what a
self-sponsored show should be?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:14.460
Think we can pull it off?

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.710
Nice job today. Thanks, everyone.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.670
Did our show today help you 
guys learn a little bit?

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:24.790
Yeah!

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.710
But...

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:29.140
I'm not really sure if 
we're at the same level...

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:31.220
The same level?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.170
We're definitely gonna 
sponsor our own show though!

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:37.690
Someday, we'll work really hard
and put on a show just like you!

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.360
Is there a point to putting 
in all that effort?

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:42.580
What?

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:48.780
Poppin' Party, you're nowhere near ready
to put on a self-sponsored live show.

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:39.250
Next Time: Sing Girls
